      "machineHash": "13ed90b39da9b0cb60fe672e28717e6934917ab0689629b32a502c6cd17019fa",
      "machineText": "**Wails menerapkan `WEBKIT_DISABLE_DMABUF_RENDERER=1` secara otomatis** ketika mendeteksi modul kernel NVIDIA (`/sys/module/nvidia`), sehingga sebagian besar pengguna tidak perlu melakukan apa pun.",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "**Wails applies `WEBKIT_DISABLE_DMABUF_RENDERER=1` automatically** when it detects the NVIDIA kernel…",
      "provider": "codex",
      "model": "gpt-5.6-sol",
      "promptVersion": "mpress-translation-v2",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-25T21:41:20Z"
    },
    "b0053-text-01": {
